Caption: 🍗 Sticky Gochujang Korean Glazed Wings 🍗
Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🍗 2 lbs chicken wings, 🌽 1/2 cup cornstarch, 🧂 salt, 🧂 pepper. Glaze: 3 tbsp gochujang, 🍅 2 tbsp soy sauce, 🍯 1/4 cup honey, 🫚 1 tbsp minced ginger, 🧄 2 cloves garlic, 🌱 sesame seeds. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Toss wings in cornstarch. 🥣 Double-fry: once at 325°F for 8 mins, then at 375°F for 3 mins until glass-like crisp. 🔥 Simmer glaze ingredients until thick. ⏲️ Toss the hot wings in the sticky sauce until fully coated. 🍳 Garnish with a heavy sprinkle of white sesame seeds and green onions.
#koreanfriedchicken #kfc #wings #spicy #asianfood #crispy #chickenwings #gochujang 🌮🍱'
