[2026-05-30 10:31:39] [CMD] browseros-cli fill -p 216 2015 Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🍫 4oz high-quality dark chocolate (60%+), 🧈 1/2 cup unsalted butter, 🥚 2 large eggs, 🥚 2 egg yolks, 🍬 1/4 cup sugar, 🌾 2 tbsp flour, 🍦 and vanilla bean ice cream. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Melt chocolate and butter together until silky. 🥣 Whisk eggs, yolks, and sugar until thick and pale. 🔥 Fold in the chocolate mixture, then the flour. ⏲️ Pour into greased and floured ramekins. 🍳 Bake at 425°F (220°C) for 12-14 mins. 🔪 The edges should be firm but the center soft. 🥧 Serve hot with a scoop of melting ice cream.
#lavacake #chocolate #dessert #sweet #baking #moltencake #chocolatelover #indulgence 🌮🍱
