Ingredients: 🍝 400g spaghetti, 🥓 150g guanciale (or pancetta), 🥚 4 large egg yolks, 🥚 1 whole egg, 🧀 1 cup freshly grated Pecorino Romano, 🧂 and lots of coarse black pepper. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Sauté the diced guanciale in a pan until the fat renders and it becomes crispy. 🥣 Whisk the eggs and cheese together in a bowl. 🔥 Boil pasta in salted water until al dente. ⏲️ Reserve 1/2 cup pasta water. 🍳 Toss hot pasta with guanciale and its fat. 🔪 Remove from heat! Quickly stir in the egg mixture, adding pasta water as needed to create a creamy, emulsified sauce.
