Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🐚 6-8 dry-packed jumbo sea scallops, 🫒 2 tbsp high-smoke point oil, 🧈 2 tbsp unsalted butter, 🌿 1 sprig fresh thyme, 🧄 1 clove garlic, 🍋 lemon juice. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Remove the side muscle and pat scallops extremely dry. 🥣 Season with salt. 🔥 Heat oil in a stainless steel pan until shimmering. ⏲️ Place scallops in the pan and don't touch for 2 minutes until a deep golden crust forms. 🍳 Flip, add butter, garlic, and thyme. 🔪 Baste the scallops with the foaming butter for 1 minute. 🥧 Finish with a squeeze of lemon.
