Caption: 🌽 State Fair Style Hand-Dipped Corn Dog 🌽
Recipe: 
Ingredients: 🥩 8 high-quality beef hot dogs, wooden sticks, 🌽 1 cup yellow cornmeal, 🌾 1 cup flour, 🍬 1/4 cup sugar, 1 tbsp baking powder, 🥚 1 egg, 🧈 1 cup buttermilk, 🫒 oil for frying. 
Steps: 👨‍🍳 Pat hot dogs dry and skewer them. 🥣 Whisk dry ingredients, then stir in egg and buttermilk to make a very thick batter. 🔥 Pour batter into a tall glass. ⏲️ Dip each dog vertically to coat completely. 🍳 Deep fry at 350°F (175°C) for 3-5 minutes, rotating slowly, until golden brown. 🔪 Serve with a classic mustard swirl.
#corndog #streetfood #fairfood #snack #crispy #classic #foodie #lunch 🌮🍱'
